#: ../../source/installation.md:618
msgid "Atlas 950 Series Server Pre-check"
msgstr "Atlas 950 系列服务器预检查"

#: ../../source/installation.md:620
msgid ""
"This pre-check applies only to Atlas 950 series servers. Other server series"
" can skip it."
msgstr "此预检查仅适用于 Atlas 950 系列服务器。其他服务器系列可跳过。"

#: ../../source/installation.md:622
msgid "**Prepare HiXLEP configuration paths**"
msgstr "**准备 HiXLEP 配置路径**"

#: ../../source/installation.md:624
#, python-format
msgid ""
"When deploying an inference service on Atlas 950 series servers, verify on "
"each server that `/lib/route.conf`, `/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`, and the "
"`/etc/hixlep` directory (which describes the UB link topology) exist and are"
" configured correctly. If any of them are missing or incorrect, follow the "
"[HiXLEP configuration file generation "
"guide](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" to generate the required content. When generating `/etc/hixlep`, use the "
"\"D2D scenario\"."
msgstr ""
"在 Atlas 950 系列服务器上部署推理服务时，请在每台服务器上检查 "
"`/lib/route.conf`、`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json` 以及描述 UB 链路拓扑的 `/etc/hixlep` "
"目录是否存在且配置正确。如果其中任何一项缺失或配置错误，请按照 [HiXLEP "
"配置文件生成指南](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" 生成所需内容。生成 `/etc/hixlep` 时，请使用“D2D 场景”。"

